{"ts": 0.03621, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSHELLTUTOR\u001b[0m  —  a vimtutor prerequisite course\r\n\r\nWelcome. A short hands-on course in \u001b[36mfive stages\u001b[0m that\r\nprepare you for \u001b[92mvimtutor\u001b[0m. About 45 to 60 minutes total.\r\n\r\nEach stage is a few short lessons followed by a small task. Pass the\r\ntask to advance. Retry as much as you like — no time pressure, no\r\nskip.\r\n\r\nYour work happens in \u001b[94m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-hg_yeo9_\u001b[0m; the tutor never writes\r\noutside that folder. Commands you run yourself have your full\r\nauthority: this is the real thing, not a simulation.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m for a quick orientation.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 652}
{"ts": 0.036782, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
