{"ts": 0.346771, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 1 · Where am I?\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93mtask\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 267}
{"ts": 0.348962, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 1 — GATE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m: run a few commands and tell me what\r\nthey printed. The script verifies your answers.\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mUnlimited retries. No skip.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 254}
{"ts": 0.349458, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.34951, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ1: Which character usually ends a shell prompt? ($, ;, :, or #)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 75}
