{"ts": 0.357577, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ2: What does \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m print?\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92myour answer:\u001b[0m ", "len": 68}
