{"ts": 0.384163, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 1 — GATE TASK\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nInside the practice prompt, run each of these once. Read each output.\r\nThen type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[92mwhoami\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mdate\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nAfter all three have run, I'll ask you what each one printed.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m only after running all three.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 320}
