{"ts": 0.472249, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97m✓ Stage 1 cleared.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nYou can now:\r\n  \u001b[92mecho          \u001b[0m \u001b[90mprint the words you give it\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mpwd           \u001b[0m \u001b[90mshow where you are\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mwhoami        \u001b[0m \u001b[90mshow who you are\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mdate          \u001b[0m \u001b[90mshow the date and time\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mclear         \u001b[0m \u001b[90mempty the screen (Ctrl+L too)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[95mTab           \u001b[0m \u001b[90mfinish a name for you\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[95mUp            \u001b[0m \u001b[90mbring back an earlier command\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[95mCtrl+C        \u001b[0m \u001b[90mstop a running command\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mNext: Stage 2 · Paths and the filesystem\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m for Stage 2, or \u001b[92mquit\u001b[93m to stop here. Your place is saved.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 685}
